  "solution": {
    "approach": "Print N pairs of numbers zero-padded to 2 digits with alternating parity order.",
    "timeComplexity": "O(N)",
    "spaceComplexity": "O(1)",
    "code": {
      "C": "#include <stdio.h>\nint main() {\n    int n; if (scanf(\"%d\", &n) != 1) return 0;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n        int a, b;\n        if (i % 2 != 0) { a = 2 * i - 1; b = 2 * i; }\n        else { a = 2 * i; b = 2 * i - 1; }\n        printf(\"%02d %02d\\n\", a, b);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "C++": "#include <iostream>\n#include <iomanip>\nusing namespace std;\nint main() {\n    int n; if (!(cin >> n)) return 0;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n        int a, b;\n        if (i % 2 != 0) { a = 2 * i - 1; b = 2 * i; }\n        else { a = 2 * i; b = 2 * i - 1; }\n        cout << setfill('0') << setw(2) << a << \" \" << setw(2) << b << \"\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "Java": "import java.util.Scanner;\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        if (sc.hasNextInt()) {\n            int n = sc.nextInt();\n            for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n                int a, b;\n                if (i % 2 != 0) { a = 2 * i - 1; b = 2 * i; }\n                else { a = 2 * i; b = 2 * i - 1; }\n                System.out.printf(\"%02d %02d\\n\", a, b);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
      "Python3": "import sys\ndef main():\n    toks = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not toks: return\n    n = int(toks[0])\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if i % 2 != 0: a, b = 2 * i - 1, 2 * i\n        else: a, b = 2 * i, 2 * i - 1\n        print(f\"{a:02d} {b:02d}\")\nif __name__ == \"__main__\": main()\n",
      "JavaScript": "const fs = require(\"fs\");\nfunction main() {\n    const toks = fs.readFileSync(0, \"utf-8\").trim().split(/\\s+/);\n    if (!toks || toks.length === 0 || toks[0] === \"\") return;\n    const n = parseInt(toks[0], 10);\n    const lines = [];\n    for (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n        let a, b;\n        if (i % 2 !== 0) { a = 2 * i - 1; b = 2 * i; }\n        else { a = 2 * i; b = 2 * i - 1; }\n        const sa = a.toString().padStart(2, \"0\");\n        const sb = b.toString().padStart(2, \"0\");\n        lines.push(`${sa} ${sb}`);\n    }\n    console.log(lines.join(\"\\n\"));\n}\nmain();\n"
    },
    "notes": "Ensure standard I/O format handling.",
    "editorial": "For line i (1-indexed): if i is odd print (2i-1, 2i), else print (2i, 2i-1), zero-padded to 2 digits."
  },
  "hints": [
    "For odd line i, first number is 2i-1, second is 2i.",
